---
// Old implementation-plan URL → the main OTA advertising page.
//
// Was a client-side meta-refresh that ALSO emitted two <link rel="canonical">
// tags — one via the Layout prop, one hand-written — which is a self-conflicting
// signal to crawlers. A server 301 is the correct instrument: it passes link
// equity, needs no HTML body, and cannot contradict itself. Matches the
// report.astro → /expedia-report redirect so the site has one redirect idiom.
return Astro.redirect('/ota-advertising', 301);
---
